WEBVTT

00:07:28.542 --> 00:07:31.699
In fact, country flags,
they tend to behave.

00:07:31.723 --> 00:07:35.010
Like, hats off to South Africa
and Turkey and Israel

00:07:35.034 --> 00:07:37.162
and Somalia and Japan and Gambia.

00:07:37.186 --> 00:07:39.704
There's a bunch
of really great country flags,

00:07:39.728 --> 00:07:43.959
but they obey good design principles
because the stakes are high.

00:07:43.983 --> 00:07:46.380
They're on the international stage.

00:07:46.404 --> 00:07:50.070
But city, state and regional flags
are another story.

00:07:51.058 --> 00:07:52.951
(Laughter)

00:07:52.975 --> 00:07:55.707
There is a scourge of bad flags --

00:07:55.731 --> 00:07:56.776
(Laughter)

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.308
and they must be stopped.

00:07:58.332 --> 00:07:59.491
(Laughter)

00:07:59.515 --> 00:08:00.737
(Applause)